<title>POLAND: HUTA OLAWA AUG NET RISES TO PLN 238.000.</title>
<headline>HUTA OLAWA AUG NET RISES TO PLN 238.000.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.23 vs   0.21</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.42 vs   0.35</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.40 vs   0.18</p>
<p> Sales		    3.95 vs   3.73</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.17 vs   2.12</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.75 vs   3.37</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.26 vs   3.14</p>
<p> Sales		   31.41 vs  26.85</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish non-ferrous metals smelter is</p>
<p>Huta Olawa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
